    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_11
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_12
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=18>Wild substitutes for all symbols \nexcept Scatter and Jackpot."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_11
    value: "<size=20>Jackpot symbol pay is a \nmultiplier of Total Bet."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12_0
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>15</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>10</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>5</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12_1
    value: "<size=20>3 or more Scatters triggers \nFree Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>ADVENTURE BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=24>- Adventure Bonus consists of 12 map pieces.\n- Each map piece
      triggers a Coin Prize, Pick Bonus, or Wheel Bonus.\n- Collect enough map symbols
      from spinning to receive map pieces.\n- Pick Bonus and Wheel Bonus are played
      using the user's Adventure Bet.\n- Adventure Bet is the average of user's bets
      upon receiving each map symbol. \n- Check your Adventure Bet anytime by tapping
      the map symbol on the \n   Adventure Bonus board."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=22><style=coinColor>Coin Prize</style>\n- Coin Prize is proportionate
      to the user's Adventure Bet.\n<style=coinColor>Pick Bonus</style>\n- Pick among
      3 rock statues to receive a bonus.\n- Bonus amounts are proportionate to the
      user's Adventure Bet.\n<style=coinColor>Wheel Bonus</style>\n- Select the Gold
      Squares to upgrade the Wheel. \n  All selected squares boost or upgrade the
      Wheel.\n- Picking                                   upgrades the coin values
      on the colored wedges by x2.\n- Picking                    unlocks more arrows
      for the Wheel.\n- Picking            ends the upgrade and spins the Wheel.\n-
      All coin values for the unlocked arrows are summed and multiplied to Adventure
      Bet."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24>- Receiving 3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games.\n- When
      triggered, a Wheel determines the number of reel sets and Wild reels \n  arrangement.\n-
      Reel set indicates how many reel sets will be spun simultaneously.\n- Wild
      reels remain Wild during the entire Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Treasure Hunter
